THE WORD LISTS. The code above is MIT. The word lists in src/lists/ (and
dist/lists/) are data under their sources' own terms, which travel with them,
each written out at the top of its file:

- words-en, pop-guesses: derived from SCOWL (http://wordlist.aspell.net/),
  Copyright 2000-2018 by Kevin Atkinson and others, under SCOWL's permissive
  notice, reproduced in each file.
- words-fr, words-de: derived from Lexique 3.83, LanguageTool's
  german-pos-dict, hermitdave's FrequencyWords and Wiktionary (via kaikki.org),
  under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 licence
  (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/), and these lists with them.
- kana-3, kana-4, kana-5: derived from JMdict, the property of the Electronic
  Dictionary Research and Development Group, under Creative Commons
  Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 and the Group's conditions
  (https://www.edrdg.org/edrdg/licence.html), and these lists with them.
- pop-answers: the package's own list, under MIT.
